      "writtenOn": "2025-05-09T01:40:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Correct, for FPC1025 and Elan 80SG, who utilize both powers, PP3300_FP serves as VCCIO and PP1800_FP as VCC. But for Egis\u0027s sensor, it only utilizes PP3300_FP.",
      "parentUuid": "1dd92762_0c3ed726",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 918,
